<title>USA: Group holds 5.05 pct Builders stake.</title>
<headline>Group holds 5.05 pct Builders stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Eligrant Inc said Tuesday it holds a 5.05 percent stake in Builders Warehouse Association Inc or 201,141 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between August 12 and August 29 at prices ranging from $7.125 and $11 per share.</p>
<p>The group bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
